# "When it dies this turn": the delayed trigger (CR 603.7b) lasts only until the turn ends. The pumped Llanowar Elves
# survive turn one; on turn three Lightning Bolt kills them and nothing is manifested - the Gorilla stays on top of the
# library. Beside the positive control in turn-inside-out-manifests-dread-when-the-pumped-creature-dies.

